        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Royal Unibrew, Faxe Brewery, Heineken\n- Places: Denmark, Germany, North America, Norway\n\nFacts:\n- Royal Unibrew brews and markets Heineken in Denmark.\n- Faxe Brewery produces Faxe in Denmark.\n- Faxe is well known in Germany for its 5% 1 litre cans.\n- Faxe is well known in North America for its 8% and 10% 500 mL cans.\n- Faxe is especially well known in Norway.",
